## PageView linkage targets (Rule 6)

Phase 0 item `i` produced this candidate list. For each, identify which tab/chip row drives the PageView.

| Candidate page | Tab rows detected | Driving row (linkage target) | Auto applies? | Skip reason |
|---|---|---|---|---|
{{PAGEVIEW_LINKAGE_TABLE}}

Driving-row selection rule when 2 rows are present: closer-to-the-list row wins. When ambiguous (both rows equidistant or both filter the same list), Phase 1 surfaces a 4th `AskUserQuestion` (safe mode) or picks closer-to-list default (auto mode).

Skip reasons that opt a candidate out of Rule 6:
- List is one-screen short (PageView between short lists is UX downgrade)
- Filter is binary toggle (use Switch, not PageView)
- Tabs are sectional (form/settings), not data-axis

Each row marked "Skip" must include a reason — empty skip cells abort the plan generation.

## Splash integration plan (Rule 7)

Populated from Phase 0 items `j` (source splash) + `k` (host central splash). Drives Phase 3 Rule 7.

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Source splash file(s) | {{SRC_SPLASH_FILES}} |
| Source splash route | {{SRC_SPLASH_ROUTE}} |
| Source splash logo asset(s) | {{SRC_SPLASH_LOGO}} |
| Source splash classification | {{SRC_SPLASH_KIND}} (logo-only / logo+animation / bespoke-init / onboarding) |
| Source visual kind | {{SRC_SPLASH_VISUAL_KIND}} (static-logo / frame-animation / video / lottie) |
| Host central splash module | {{HOST_SPLASH_MODULE}} (e.g. module_base_page) |
| Host splash factory | {{HOST_SPLASH_FACTORY}} (e.g. `buildBasePageRoutes(splashLogoAsset:)`) |
| Host splash route constant | {{HOST_SPLASH_ROUTE_CONST}} (e.g. `BasePageRouteConstant.splash`) |
| Host widget-injection capability | {{HOST_SPLASH_CAPABILITY}} (L0 / L1 / L2) |
| Host integration guide path | {{HOST_INTEGRATION_GUIDE}} |
| Strategy | {{SPLASH_STRATEGY}} (A: logo-replacement / B: inject-as-background / C: extend-init / extend-host-first / keep-source) |
| Chosen logo to pass to host (Path A) | {{CHOSEN_LOGO_PATH}} |
| Content widget target path (Path B) | {{CONTENT_WIDGET_PATH}} (e.g. `lib/features/<src-name>/splash/widgets/<src_name>_splash_content.dart`) |
| Source init side-effects to port (Path C) | {{SRC_SPLASH_INIT_LIST}} |
| Host extension required (Step 6) | {{HOST_EXTENSION_REQUIRED}} (yes/no — yes when capability is L0/L1 and Path B chosen) |

If `Strategy = keep-source`, mark Rule 7 as skipped in the adapter rules table and document why (typically: host has no central splash module).

If `Strategy = extend-host`, each row in `Source init side-effects to port` must include the destination decision:

| Side-effect | Destination |
|---|---|
| (example) `await registerDevice()` | already covered by host SplashViewModel — drop |
| (example) `precacheImage(splashBg)` | move to post-`initServiceCenter` in main.dart |
| (example) `_loadFeatureFlag()` | fold into `ServiceCenterConfig.builder()` chain |

